[TITLE]
NUM-23: SI transect with a station width factor (Wfactor) of 1.5
T1: stations 0/10/30/40 m, banks 10/30, Wfactor 1.5. T2: the same section with the stations
already multiplied (0/15/45/60 m, banks 15/45). n = 0.10 / 0.10 / 0.03.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CMS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
START_DATE 01/01/2020
START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE 01/01/2020
END_TIME 01:00:00
REPORT_STEP 00:15:00
ROUTING_STEP 5

[JUNCTIONS]
;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1 30 5 0 0 0
J2 30 5 0 0 0

[OUTFALLS]
O1 29.7 FREE
O2 29.7 FREE

[CONDUITS]
;Name From To Length N InOffset OutOffset InitFlow MaxFlow
C1 J1 O1 300 0.03 0 0 0 0
C2 J2 O2 300 0.03 0 0 0 0

[XSECTIONS]
;Link Shape Transect Geom2 Geom3 Geom4 Barrels
C1 IRREGULAR T1 0 0 0 1
C2 IRREGULAR T2 0 0 0 1

[INFLOWS]
;Node Constituent TimeSeries Type Mfactor Sfactor Baseline
J1 FLOW "" FLOW 1.0 1.0 5
J2 FLOW "" FLOW 1.0 1.0 5

[TRANSECTS]
;X1 Name Nsta Xleft Xright 0 0 Lfactor Wfactor Eoffset
NC 0.10 0.10 0.03
X1 T1 4 10 30 0 0 0 1.5 0
GR 32 0 30 10 30 30 32 40
NC 0.10 0.10 0.03
X1 T2 4 15 45 0 0 0 0 0
GR 32 0 30 15 30 45 32 60

[REPORT]
INPUT YES
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
